{"4190280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chained Sun", "steam_appid": 4190280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chained Sun</strong> is a 3d singleplayer action survival with a tiled randomly generated world.  Embark on a medieval - fantasy themed world where you fight enemies and have to defeat a boss to progress to the next world. Gather food to sustain you on your journey and loot or purchase items to strengthen yourself to face the dangers ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190280/extras/3e3e4821493949f735fd92e710caeab0.poster.avif?t=1769754191\" width=1000 height=1000 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190280/extras/3e3e4821493949f735fd92e710caeab0.webm?t=1769754191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190280/extras/3e3e4821493949f735fd92e710caeab0.mp4?t=1769754191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Npcs exist that can assist you on your journey following precisely in and out of combat and using their abilities when ordered. Once stopped being commanded to follow or use abilities they rush <strong>straight</strong> back into combat! <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190280/extras/604c8f4e863b990dceacc9f6c4da68b6.poster.avif?t=1769754191\" width=1000 height=1000 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190280/extras/604c8f4e863b990dceacc9f6c4da68b6.webm?t=1769754191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190280/extras/604c8f4e863b990dceacc9f6c4da68b6.mp4?t=1769754191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between <strong>2</strong> characters and harness <strong>lightning</strong> from a legendary blade to survive ambushes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190280/extras/e4cbb945de4cd90ec74b39b3513aa3de.poster.avif?t=1769754191\" width=1000 height=1000 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190280/extras/e4cbb945de4cd90ec74b39b3513aa3de.webm?t=1769754191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190280/extras/e4cbb945de4cd90ec74b39b3513aa3de.mp4?t=1769754191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use runes which grant temporary powers of flight, speed and a shield that prevents enemy passage and provides a small amount of healing. Allies use them as well! 💎</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190280/extras/a3c95f73f4ef4abc56c4ed511744a856.poster.avif?t=1769754191\" width=1000 height=1000 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190280/extras/a3c95f73f4ef4abc56c4ed511744a856.webm?t=1769754191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190280/extras/a3c95f73f4ef4abc56c4ed511744a856.mp4?t=1769754191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replenish your runes by exploring, gathering and playing a quick minigame! Each rune is found and brought in the world in a <strong>unique</strong> way which happens naturally during gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190280/extras/b845ec1e02c355fe51fa1614e0a3b209.poster.avif?t=1769754191\" width=1000 height=1000 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190280/extras/b845ec1e02c355fe51fa1614e0a3b209.webm?t=1769754191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190280/extras/b845ec1e02c355fe51fa1614e0a3b209.mp4?t=1769754191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire an energy <strong>missile</strong> which consumes hunger and obliterate whatever stands in your way! Hunger provides buffs in damage and speed when full while debuffing you when low! Augment your abilities by purchasing <strong>skills</strong> with your level up points! <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190280/extras/f1e2708ac9d12d480aa74c960e73128c.poster.avif?t=1769754191\" width=1000 height=1000 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190280/extras/f1e2708ac9d12d480aa74c960e73128c.webm?t=1769754191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190280/extras/f1e2708ac9d12d480aa74c960e73128c.mp4?t=1769754191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chained Sun</strong> is a 3d singleplayer action survival with a tiled randomly generated world.  Embark on a medieval - fantasy themed world where you fight enemies and have to defeat a boss to progress to the 